# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Required for: Photorealistic 3D Tiles (Map Tiles API) + Maps JavaScript API
#
# HOW TO GET THIS KEY:
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library
# 2. Create a new project (e.g. "LAWS Simulator")
# 3. Enable "Maps JavaScript API"
# 4. Enable "Map Tiles API"
# 5. Go to Credentials → Create API Key
# 6. Restrict key to HTTP referrers: localhost:3000/*, *.sim.sovdash.com/*
# 7. Enable billing (Google gives $200/month free credit)
#
# Paste your key below, then rename this file to .env.local

NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=YOUR_KEY_HERE
